DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.21971441


================================================================================
SCOPE — read this first
================================================================================

This repository is dual-licensed, because it contains two different kinds of
work and one kind of thing that is not licensed here at all.

1. DATA AND DOCUMENTATION -- Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
   Applies to: deposit/, docs/, README.md, and every .csv and .md file.

2. CODE -- MIT License
   Applies to: scripts/ and every .R file.

3. THE UNDERLYING GLOBAL FINDEX MICRODATA -- NOT COVERED BY EITHER LICENCE
   No individual-level Findex record is contained in this repository, and none
   is redistributed by it. The Findex microdata remain governed solely by the
   World Bank's own terms of use and must be obtained from the World Bank.
   The aggregates in deposit/ are derived works computed from those data; the
   licences above cover the derived aggregates and the code, not the source.

   Third-party documents cited in docs/ -- World Bank questionnaires, IFSB
   reports, central bank publications -- remain the property of their
   publishers and are referenced by URL and checksum, never redistributed here.


